%% render.orientation: landscape
sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser as Steward's browser
  participant Controller as Billing::ControllerConcern#show
  participant Queue as ActiveJob queue
  participant Job as SyncCheckoutSessionJob
  participant Stripe as Stripe API
  participant Broadcaster as CheckoutSessionSyncBroadcaster
  participant Cable as Turbo Streams / ActionCable

  Browser->>Controller: GET billing, checkout_session_id param present
  Note over Controller: valid_checkout_session_id? true
  Controller->>Queue: enqueue SyncCheckoutSessionJob
  Controller-->>Browser: renders immediately, pending region<br/>spinner, role status, aria-live polite
  Note over Browser: page opens a turbo_stream_from<br/>subscription keyed on the checkout session id

  Queue->>Job: perform checkout_session_id, owner_type, owner_id
  Job->>Stripe: Checkout Session retrieve / Subscription retrieve<br/>via StripeCheckoutSessionSync
  Stripe-->>Job: session and subscription data

  alt sync succeeds
    Job->>Broadcaster: call with checkout_session_id and result
  else Stripe InvalidRequestError, bad session id
    Note over Job: not retried, a rejected session id<br/>will never succeed on retry
    Job->>Broadcaster: call with checkout_session_id and error
  else other StandardError
    Note over Job: retry_on StandardError,<br/>polynomial backoff, up to 10 attempts
    Job->>Queue: re-enqueue for retry
  end

  opt result has a one time payment, sponsorship contribution
    Broadcaster->>Broadcaster: ProcessSponsorshipContributionFromCheckoutSync
    Note over Broadcaster: credits the beneficiary Stripe balance,<br/>idempotent, same guard as the webhook leg
  end

  Broadcaster->>Cable: broadcast_replace_to the checkout session stream<br/>target is the pending region dom id
  Cable-->>Browser: Turbo Stream replace
  Note over Browser: pending spinner is replaced in place<br/>with the resolved success or alert banner,<br/>no page reload

  Note over Job,Stripe: The webhook driven leg, StripeEventProcessor,<br/>is the authoritative sync path and runs independently.<br/>This diagram covers only the best effort,<br/>immediate feedback browser return leg.
